      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0188464f6604bb7859ea87fcbef3c2a4.avif?t=1762420869\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a farm manager and take on the KPI challenges set by TimeTech Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards in thrilling, fast-paced moments,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dodge or harness Time Explosions 💥,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unlock card packs and treasure chests to expand your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your cards to earn gold,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and chart your own path with strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll face branching events, harsh years, and even massive world-shaking cataclysms. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0f0c63a9e73f7c93070293ac970321ab.avif?t=1762420869\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong> <br><br><br> You are granted a magical bag filled with countless unique cards, each with its own Time Cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, you must balance a limited Time cap as you draw as many cards as you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😮 One more card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😏 Another one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😫 Just one more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is always yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision could be a stroke of brilliance, or the start of a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware: exceed your Time cap and a Time Explosion 💥 will erupt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all explosions are disasters, though—play the right cards, and you can twist them into opportunities or avoid them entirely 👌 <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8f99f26a09c9702538e8f2a89b6cf50d.avif?t=1762420869\" width=765 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span>The game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 unique cards—including spells, plants, animals, buildings, and products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 powerful trinkets designed to create combos with different builds or enhance your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many options, the game offers dozens of distinct strategies, each providing its own unique experience.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/3291db59f38d0f7f1ac15d973fa04eea.avif?t=1762420869\" width=794 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span>With time as your guiding thread, your journey will challenge you with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ impactful map events filled with meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ harsh years that are difficult to overcome but rich in rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ massive cataclysms with unique mechanics to test your resilience. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/d0eae589796c2671671006ee61eddc03.avif?t=1762420869\" width=782 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br>Open card packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock supply crates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even try your luck with scratch cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, new cards, and powerful trinkets—the game offers multiple ways to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reward system is designed to create richer experiences and deeper paths for player progression.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0188464f6604bb7859ea87fcbef3c2a4.avif?t=1762420869\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a farm manager and take on the KPI challenges set by TimeTech Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards in thrilling, fast-paced moments,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dodge or harness Time Explosions 💥,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unlock card packs and treasure chests to expand your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your cards to earn gold,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and chart your own path with strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll face branching events, harsh years, and even massive world-shaking cataclysms. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0f0c63a9e73f7c93070293ac970321ab.avif?t=1762420869\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong> <br><br><br> You are granted a magical bag filled with countless unique cards, each with its own Time Cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, you must balance a limited Time cap as you draw as many cards as you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😮 One more card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😏 Another one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😫 Just one more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is always yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision could be a stroke of brilliance, or the start of a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware: exceed your Time cap and a Time Explosion 💥 will erupt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all explosions are disasters, though—play the right cards, and you can twist them into opportunities or avoid them entirely 👌 <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8f99f26a09c9702538e8f2a89b6cf50d.avif?t=1762420869\" width=765 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span>The game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 unique cards—including spells, plants, animals, buildings, and products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 powerful trinkets designed to create combos with different builds or enhance your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many options, the game offers dozens of distinct strategies, each providing its own unique experience.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/3291db59f38d0f7f1ac15d973fa04eea.avif?t=1762420869\" width=794 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span>With time as your guiding thread, your journey will challenge you with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ impactful map events filled with meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ harsh years that are difficult to overcome but rich in rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ massive cataclysms with unique mechanics to test your resilience. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/d0eae589796c2671671006ee61eddc03.avif?t=1762420869\" width=782 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1762420869\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1762420869 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br>Open card packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock supply crates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even try your luck with scratch cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, new cards, and powerful trinkets—the game offers multiple ways to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reward system is designed to create richer experiences and deeper paths for player progression.</p>",
      "short_description": "Rana Card is a roguelike deck-builder where you play as a farm manager chasing TimeTech's KPI targets. Draw cards in high-stakes moments, survive Time Explosions, and unlock powerful cards. Build your deck, chart your own path, and face branching events and cataclysmic years on the road to success.",
